        "id": "2097446981677580539",
        "text": "Palantir CEO Alex Karp says the rise of Germany's AfD party is due to \"very deep and large migration into Germany without the buy-in of the German people, and without an honest discussion of the consequences.\"\n\n\"AfD is much stronger than they appear. I have friends who 5 years ago were telling me they would never vote for the AfD, who are voting for the AfD, who are social democrats.\"\n\n\"And then when the AfD is polling at 40%—there's another 10 points above that that would vote for them if they weren't the AfD.\"\n\nVia Mathias Döpfner",
